{"matched":51,"pages":[{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0444a01","n":"0444a","t":"具等即皆雙答然有難處論覆"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0444b01","n":"0444b","t":"不善性攝發惡業者必不善故"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0444c01","n":"0444c","t":"七慢中於下品及中品起第一"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0445b01","n":"0445b","t":"等是字界界是性義由毘字是"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0445c01","n":"0445c","t":"既非實有亦非虛偽唯是依他"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0446a01","n":"0446a","t":"謂如以色為我於餘四蘊各有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0446b01","n":"0446b","t":"見根本亦分別我見如何別緣"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0446c01","n":"0446c","t":"前已說此四由執大梵大種或"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0447a01","n":"0447a","t":"有分限故此在欲界全色界一"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0447b01","n":"0447b","t":"無想執色命根為我於此二中"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0447c01","n":"0447c","t":"四大種所造為性死後斷滅畢"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0448a01","n":"0448a","t":"相違如別抄會然此見寬如增"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0448b01","n":"0448b","t":"餘問我不得定答我若定答勿"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0448c01","n":"0448c","t":"在天也世主即是大自在天為"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0449a01","n":"0449a","t":"漏無漏果生故不死矯亂通四"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0449c01","n":"0449c","t":"有二初正分別後異解釋此等"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0450b01","n":"0450b","t":"不得俱起愛境必決疑必不定"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0450c01","n":"0450c","t":"五五十八俱說不相應若久思"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0451a01","n":"0451a","t":"全說不與瞋俱瑜伽約三見少"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0451b01","n":"0451b","t":"明有二種相應無明與一切俱"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0451c01","n":"0451c","t":"分別所起貪等由意分別貪等"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0452a01","n":"0452a","t":"隨意有無唯是正義以地獄無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0452b01","n":"0452b","t":"二師俱不違分別煩惱二師皆"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0452c01","n":"0452c","t":"等逐難解已義之餘也述曰此"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0453b01","n":"0453b","t":"生二依外門轉簡見道貪等唯"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0453c01","n":"0453c","t":"得第四定增上慢比丘謂是第"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0454a01","n":"0454a","t":"起唯得起下六謂邪見瞋癡愛"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0454b01","n":"0454b","t":"論中說總緣行中不言貪者略"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0455a01","n":"0455a","t":"理應思此中有義亦得緣下疑"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0455b01","n":"0455b","t":"相應故煩惱雖九品違一或三"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0455c01","n":"0455c","t":"種種分別故皆迷滅道其煩惱"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0456a01","n":"0456a","t":"者說理亦無失問此十迷四諦"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0456b01","n":"0456b","t":"諦以說八故略而不論二取貪"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0456c01","n":"0456c","t":"及此俱愛慢無明三雖親迷苦"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0457a01","n":"0457a","t":"有無之煩惱或直據本質名此"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0457b01","n":"0457b","t":"漏而所杖本質亦通無漏唯影"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0457c01","n":"0457c","t":"勢非強勝然非因故不名根本"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0458a01","n":"0458a","t":"辨其假實顯此所依若無諍義"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0458c01","n":"0458c","t":"貪利譽故邪命為依謂矯誑之"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0459a01","n":"0459a","t":"緣無漏如彼文為正前惱中亦"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0459b01","n":"0459b","t":"對法五蘊云自不恥為無慚法"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0461a01","n":"0461a","t":"餘法為因果故若於染法不忍"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0461c01","n":"0461c","t":"有不然應說通障餘故述曰下"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0462b01","n":"0462b","t":"故具此三義一非煩惱二唯染"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0462c01","n":"0462c","t":"今不依彼彼不正故一一皆通"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0463a01","n":"0463a","t":"不遍不可為例即惛掉行相俱"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0463b01","n":"0463b","t":"說此受相應之行相者述曰問"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0464b01","n":"0464b","t":"無記故不與愛俱又不謗滅故"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0464c01","n":"0464c","t":"此據本質若影像者皆唯自地"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0465a01","n":"0465a","t":"子門第二迷諦總別皆通四部"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0465b01","n":"0465b","t":"九品潤生發業門等皆如理思"}],"scheme":"cbeta","slug":"cbeta-T-T43n1830-成唯識論述記卷006b","source":"CBETA T43n1830 @ xml-p5 dbdea41","total":115,"unit":"T43 頁欄"}